!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/schema/invalid/a-tagged-array-construction-at-a-field-is-refused-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/schema-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.2, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.3 (inline types, proposed for Revision 40)"
  description: """
    An author's `!` construction is not admitted at a field position, whatever its constructor: only a sugar form or
    an application of a constructor writes a type in place. `!meta.array { element_type: uuid }` at `ids` is
    refused, though `[uuid]` and `meta.array<uuid>` there resolve to that construction; declared, `ids_list =>
    !meta.array { element_type: uuid }`, it is an entry like any other.
    """
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
